{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近レッスン終わって帰ってくると0時近くになってしまうぅぅ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ毎日ずっとだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅くにごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつもたくさんのコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASH見たよ！って言うコメントがたくさん来てて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週一週間は、ロケに地方イベントに収録に撮影に取材に、大忙しでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日はいよいよイベントです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く皆さんに会いたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに元気やパワーを与えられるように、明日も精一杯頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、早く皆さんに会いたくて堪らないわ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとだけ質問に答えます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ファンレター送ってもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・もちろん良いですよ！\nありがとうございます(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさんのファンレターや色紙を受け取りました♪\n本当にありがとうございます！\n皆さんの声援がほんっとに嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○好きな色は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・単色だと黄色とかオレンジとか白！\n明るい色が好きです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きなのはパステルカラー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○貰って嬉しい物は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・本当に有り難い気持ちでいっぱいなので、どんな物でも嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに見掛けに寄らず、テディベアとか好きだったりします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ひつまぶしは食べた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・食べましたよー！\n名古屋では、手羽先・味噌カツ・ひつまぶし・味噌煮込みうどん・あんかけスパを食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも美味しかったのでまた名古屋行った時に食べたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(>_<)\n今日はこんな感じで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではイベントで皆さんに会えるのを楽しみにしています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/29/dvc00381.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}